{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "954d116faa02e3a238f5f2c1a255e24113010079e0bd7799195eacc03d25b18e", "ja": "『賢者の石』", "zh": "『贤者之石』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bbde53f953e17e108c6f46db3633ca3810d37531586bd65675bf8e1b19643039", "ja": "『暁の砲弾』とロボットたちの戦闘の最中、\nメグミが起こした混乱に乗じ、セリカらは\nタマキと、囚われていたアカネを救出する。\nロボットたちの目的は、アカネが紡いだ、\n蒸気機関（オートマタ）の研究だった。", "zh": "在与《拂晓的炮弹》和机器人们交战期间，  \n星梨花等人借着惠美制造的混乱，  \n救出了环以及被囚禁的茜。  \n机器人的目的，是茜所开展的  \n蒸汽机关（自动机）研究。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1000_se", "source_sha256": "8fab0797d12fb9e0ba26d500ed3ee6ea5f371c431d6f017cf009ea2f63e5b967", "ja": "ファン、ファファーン！", "zh": "粉丝，粉粉——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1001_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "aeebe5a36589c521b6dc33d63f104e6f63555c4aea365cab22a689c4bfe5b3ad", "ja": "マツリ様、到着しました！", "zh": "马茨莉大人，已抵达！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "d7f3c18b3f2deaa58a93c313d3e4280e9255ff0a218dcd32905b55b62a5b4126", "ja": "（来た！　あれがマツリなのか？　顔がよく……\n……！　隣にいるのは、アカネ！？）", "zh": "（来了！那就是茉莉吗？脸看不清……\n……！她旁边的是，茜！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1003_akatukinohoudanmennba", "source_sha256": "0084ebb17698331fa3d9ff52274f8700fe249320f62ac9aa5724202a6bd4c257", "ja": "今だ！　かかれ！！", "zh": "就是现在！上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1004_akatukinohoudanmennba", "source_sha256": "af20114363d3eec4acec5df78264e9a397cf9e84600b55ffce26681c52d34351", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "211dd11ee115a4f4e5df342ac10f7eba99b0339a3871b9420e62762e222206c5", "ja": "（アカネ！　今助けるからね！）", "zh": "（茜！我现在就来救你！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1006_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "fae0ab7535fadf7f756de6789e6edb79d131ab5fa137635cc1030c1f0bf9a374", "ja": "全体整列！　反乱分子たちを抑えろ！", "zh": "全体整队！压制那些叛乱分子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1007_se", "source_sha256": "850e3462e3e690a39454fba7986f2bfd53c582725d35f48cbe9c7bdcaad06dee", "ja": "ザッ！！", "zh": "唰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "90f9b4d32c984a11de443667c5456322c57952ac7cda94fa434a6166554ed416", "ja": "！　囲まれてる！？　なんで！？", "zh": "！被包围了！？为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "979d61be79afa5532d33fda3a097489d10ebdba76fe516e54640bcd8bf6d99e2", "ja": "人間とは、やはり愚かなものですね。", "zh": "人类果然是愚蠢的存在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "2bf3990751b227bd810bacc168e736197dd0a07f0715bf48cccf8e546097d3d5", "ja": "お前は……お前が計画をロボットたちに？\n裏切ったのか！", "zh": "你……你把计划告诉那些机器人了？\n你背叛了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "dc2dab056eb97e58549b7e1d6a4ab45dc2a3235046a4b0d98fd79f244d886986", "ja": "裏切ってなどいませんよ。罠にかけただけです。\nなぜなら……、私がマツリなのですから。", "zh": "我可没有背叛哦。只是设下了陷阱而已。因为……我就是茉莉嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "e79cadfbe5bd2b55eb6f3520469e4ba3f24f07a6763e6c8ef832ae7e49c3fe02", "ja": "な……！　お前が……！？\nじゃあ、なんで式典の情報を……？", "zh": "什……！居然是你……！？\n那你为什么要把典礼的信息……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "b66b309d7e12a29b61eed5ac1f47a9b4ae8eb253818c9a6c44dd9f4a0fff20c8", "ja": "蟻を寄せ集めるために決まっているでしょう。\n一匹ずつ潰すのは非効率ですから。", "zh": "这还用说，自然是为了把蚂蚁引到一处。\n一只一只去消灭，效率太低了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "ff5f521438cab9fe570b626043308af36972057117c688b807b2a3a590697419", "ja": "おめでとう、ひとときの間だけでも、夢を見る\nことができて。……では、さようなら。", "zh": "恭喜你，哪怕只有短暂的一刻，也能做一场梦。……那么，再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1016_se", "source_sha256": "46af99620db277cce33857c2091e79e1154e98a14162bc782d02d42b02424152", "ja": "カッ！　……ドガーーーン！！！", "zh": "咔！……轰——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "848df1250ef01a64aec33aa824be2ef6660c15c348c67d92d4c5eab2ed4786e6", "ja": "何っ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "a158cd774c08b2d7c5e4d4b9df83e4c0605d3a940c388807818d56af426cdbba", "ja": "タマキ、走って！", "zh": "环！快跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a5b39bc6df9df5b369626fbb05444e6d1da8cf1efd47d910b1d1738376490e1", "ja": "セリカ！？", "zh": "星梨花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "412b2f94bfb2e0a10aa76dc1507d7f7dd87b940ba68fdc1f5043fdfced310c6c", "ja": "立て！　この混乱に乗じて逃げるぞ！", "zh": "站起来！趁着这阵混乱逃出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3282519b555731280e197c5817ea89dab7c80f98c2504b781471cb034569d98", "ja": "！！　あなたは……！", "zh": "！！你是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1c626a722a86688f045126bab68c15a34ee13e11b038157dfcb2fd126b0db1a", "ja": "ほらほら、もういっちょいくよ！　おりゃっ！！", "zh": "快快，再来一次！嘿呀！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1023_se", "source_sha256": "5f0b07a63aed7773194f645168c0d5976500a460d311206233fc9ca4d35fa3a6", "ja": "ドガーーーン！！！", "zh": "轰——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "983efb13e727473db065f0153b95712fcffa0205c67006f0b794c3d6784f006e", "ja": "んふふふふ！　急ごしらえの爆弾にしては\nいい感じですぅ！　まだまだありますよぉーっ！！", "zh": "嗯呵呵呵呵！以赶工做出来的炸弹来说\n效果还真不错呢！我这里还有很多哦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "f9baab7529d439fd0b6b107375264bdd7dbd7d78452a1935a3545cd92150196f", "ja": "もういいよユキホ、時間は稼げたし！\nアタシたちも行くよ！", "zh": "已经够了雪步，时间争取到了！\n我们也走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c2a5958a02deeecb2617837d2a3e1300ff5913788ec26065b82bb6e2a256391", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……、どうにか、逃げきれたみたいだね。", "zh": "哈、哈……看来总算逃出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "8b40c495df8affe7958804c4dc2afbcd1e00cfba89dcc4040b4d6e228aa1859c", "ja": "けど、こっちもマツリを逃がしちゃったな。\n次の機会を待つしかないか。", "zh": "不过，我们也让茉莉逃掉了啊。\n看来只能等下次机会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "c6e0c9cde684cfe1d4e4b1e81fefd4c248be12402c566b2706520cc2ab97cd9d", "ja": "セリカ、どうして……。", "zh": "星梨花，为什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "834d777b503497768dc513b9a7a42a3b1760431ab1ea3b1623cfffed4f5b1b09", "ja": "タマキのバカ！　心配したんだから！\n……でも、無事でよかった。……アカネも。", "zh": "环，你这个笨蛋！我担心死了！\n……不过，没事就好。……茜也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "2a3d8ff2563a28721d5865c77515fcbb2a2f383581a108a535d45ebff26900a1", "ja": "ありがとう。ふたりが助けに来てくれるなんて……\nそれにミナコ王子まで。", "zh": "谢谢你们。没想到你们两个会来救我……  \n而且连美奈子王子也来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "dff374ff0e8821b35a692b9dafeefe20873703cf36635c655e9d6056183f25ed", "ja": "王子……？　王子！？", "zh": "王子……？王子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "0f7b68630a9d0b3ea0d6847dc2e400f4c2b6e8a573deed34109a3e1aa33f9d73", "ja": "おお～。思ってたより大物だったんだね？", "zh": "哦～原来你比我想的还要厉害啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "a552f09bb4ae30dfa57717f7a36e88a61fd423d94d18fdf3c11ef8dc4b870ca8", "ja": "あはは、たいして権力ないけどね！\n……あれ？　セリカには言ってなかったっけ？", "zh": "啊哈哈，其实根本没什么权力啦！\n……咦？我没跟星梨花说过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "2dfe63e47d8502400069106cd14efae4182501dad1276ae43757299f031a8039", "ja": "聞いてません……。", "zh": "我没听说过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "876818976f8c69ecc16552734cafc536a98f9005348f46cf91bd715ca56e3939", "ja": "そっか、友達なのにごめん！　マツリが父の排斥に動い\nたから、止めようと城を抜け出してきたんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊，明明是朋友，对不起！因为玛茨莉要驱逐父亲，我为了阻止她才逃出了城堡，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "2d6e73e1ba13642b6f05dedd81e1c5a3e988661860e9c30b825f7f98fcf8e1e6", "ja": "お金が尽きて行き倒れてしまって。\nいやぁセリカがいなきゃどうなっていたか。あはは！", "zh": "钱花光了，结果就倒在路边了。哎呀，要不是有星梨花在，真不知道会变成什么样。啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6c479393e36fcbf947c3421631458efd81e3ac7bdb3df2ee5c4ebe1ef8a9dc7a", "ja": "とんだボンボンですぅ……。", "zh": "真是个养尊处优的大少爷呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "4a7374362689bef2afff7af52f53a1023cd6a016bb5995ef3185ddf075449800", "ja": "だけど、『賢者の石』が彼らに奪われていなくて\nよかったよ。守ってくれてたのは……？", "zh": "不过，《贤者之石》没有被他们夺走，真是太好了。保护它的是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "819c3367061109ee2d8d68e3693ba0d9a1afbfc70fc1c30e803227d097b08639", "ja": "はい、この子たちです。\nタマキ、預けた石は、今持ってる？", "zh": "是的，就是这孩子们。\n环，交给你保管的石头，现在还带着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1040_040tam", "source_sha256": "1fb0184260cc40d4581623468ae3b4c644b9854051323d0ac1902900c5f02f38", "ja": "あ、うん。\n半分にして、もう半分は、セリカに。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n分成两半，一半给了星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "ef22d80a030fd4de7a9c4963914f9855f2e6d308322e7a1ab910b4dc9565e33e", "ja": "えっ？　もしかして、あの時のペンダント……。\nあれが『賢者の石』だったの？　えっと、ここに……。", "zh": "咦？难道说，那时候的吊坠……  \n那就是“贤者之石”吗？呃，在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1042_019min", "source_sha256": "9d702682f5957e0903e6b00f7eb37e0405deef12f0f00c7577f05c94f0249461", "ja": "なるほど、半分にするとは考えたね。\n奪われる危険も減るし。このふたつを合わせると……。", "zh": "原来如此，把它一分为二，真亏你想得到。\n这样也能降低被抢走的风险。把这两个合在一起的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1043_se", "source_sha256": "b61a5d606f962a50201356504fedd2db0271e7159fd6df213fa3826a413c7f77", "ja": "ポゥ……", "zh": "噗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "aa95e72b37d09fe059914ec7169ffc30da3c562b127b01c8ee6f0d41cb72fe95", "ja": "わ、石が光った！\nあれ？　壁に何か映ってるけど……これって図面？", "zh": "哇，石头在发光！\n咦？墙上映出了什么东西……这是设计图？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3ddedf77b5378052d9af150c5e2a3cbb03314b7a964ec618f9c7dcf2493d9951", "ja": "えっ？　この図面、もしかして……？", "zh": "咦？这张图纸，难道是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "19edc555d88bc3a7f85cf758a57d021b93a409deb6338a00eca35a8350e654fa", "ja": "蒸気機関（オートマタ）？", "zh": "蒸汽机（自动机械）？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "5be331178a11a87c85660a78085f3cab4db5f60c5a80b99892e16843f1fee45d", "ja": "そう。先人たちが繋いできた叡智の結晶、\n蒸気機関の構造図面。アカネが読み解いたんだ。", "zh": "没错。这是先辈们传承下来的智慧结晶——蒸汽机关的结构图纸。是茜解读出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1048_022ser", "source_sha256": "39a970a9565526be969ce218f17447d646cdad6cb47dff2698a47d7165c6fbcc", "ja": "アカネが……。\nだから政府に連れていかれたんだ？", "zh": "茜她……所以才被政府带走了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "25072ca0a45768a7eae5631f72ca6ca83ab98fd90e39653bed4bdabc73fc27ec", "ja": "まだ誰も到達してない技術……！\nこれがあれば、機関の可能性が一気に広がりますぅ。", "zh": "这是还没有任何人达成过的技术……！\n有了这个，机构的可能性就会一下子拓展开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1050_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc648c0ba422765ae3a9df4c08c4567a6bc977a66cb9cd36379d9524d292bdda", "ja": "人間をロボットに近づけたり、\n逆にロボットを、人間に近づけたり！", "zh": "让人类更接近机器人，\n或者反过来，让机器人更接近人类！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9b0e76c6231bc45c86a243dc9db2e40cd3210ce79b182c4a6418b8752ea733b", "ja": "アカネ。その、蒸気機関があれば、\n私たちもロボットと戦えるの？", "zh": "茜。那个，如果有蒸汽机的话，我们也能和机器人战斗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1052_040tam", "source_sha256": "04d84ebbd2d04e468d35165ce711f75c999fa1817abf1dac342673ed9d06a713", "ja": "！　もっと強くなれる？\nマツリを、倒せるくらい！", "zh": "！能变得更强吗？\n强到能打倒茉莉那种程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1053_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a3d28ae3edc382b7017292c1b3f0e1ffefcf550114f522b0af6c43c6de350cb", "ja": "もちろん。ま、資材はいろいろ必要だけどね。\n特に内燃機関。ただ、古いほうがいいんだけど。", "zh": "当然了。不过嘛，需要各种各样的材料就是了。\n特别是内燃机。不过，还是老旧一点的比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1054_019min", "source_sha256": "faf08df459531e03ced73e8c2305998577e95914abb881860a673bebfc7388b3", "ja": "古い内燃機関なら、採掘場に心当たりがある。\nちょっとばかり遠いんだけど……。", "zh": "要是老式内燃机的话，我知道一处采掘场可能有。就是稍微有点远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1055_020meg", "source_sha256": "4a0ffb492817ce3ae1ca1ca190e7d0a02ab9fd470f84beb3e66979aff16b8926", "ja": "アタシたちも協力するよ。『相棒』で飛べるし……\nコトハとも、どこかで会えそうだしね。", "zh": "我们也会帮忙的。还能乘『搭档』飞过去……\n而且说不定也能在什么地方遇到琴叶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1057_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2c8f9040c359ca8ecbdc83b9329f036397d81172afdce40b338c66950942c202", "ja": "とりあえず、早く出発したほうがいいですよぉ。\n誰か近づいて来るみたいです。複数かな？", "zh": "总之，还是尽快出发比较好哦。\n好像有人正在靠近。是好几个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1058_019min", "source_sha256": "0b48e4b1207d3e90689bd2ac775a33463b9dabb5ceb5e71fba6b784014b40b1d", "ja": "おっと。それじゃ、みんなで行こうか。\nちょっと、みんなの大切な物を取り戻しにね！", "zh": "哎呀。那就大家一起走吧。去把大家珍视的东西夺回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1059_null", "source_sha256": "f62373f88f0798c9cca26f73f9bfc9be13349d18d81976a837da476321893c26", "ja": "……この『賢者の石』の解析は、後の人々にとって、\n大きな転換点となったのだった。", "zh": "……对后人而言，解析出这块“贤者之石”，\n成为了一个巨大的转折点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_06_1060_null", "source_sha256": "64c75b240d57e25dbb96ec08de155e111b95b47a0a5d2a645a35c61b234fdd16", "ja": "それは、また別の物語で……。", "zh": "那是另一个故事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
